// Hair, drawn over the head (body.sprite) in the hair slot (h light, i mid, j dark), lit from the upper left.
// Hair is a pixel bigger than the head all round, which is what makes a 12-pixel head read as a full head of hair.
// Steps reuse the standing frame.

